Package: bincraftR
Title: Toolbox For Building R Package Binaries on Linux
Version: 2.1.0.9999
Authors@R:
    person("Patrick", "Schratz", , "mail@devxy.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build, archive, remove and update R binary packages
    on Linux. Binaries are stored in S3. Creation and curation of package index files is supported.
    Build metadata can be optionally stored in a database.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://codefloe.com/rpkgs/bincraftr, https://bincraftr.doc.rpkgs.com
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
